    <string name="about_body">MissionPlayer is an offline, ad-free music player.\n\nFeatures:\n• Songs, playlists, albums, artists, folders and genres\n• Mini player and full Now Playing screen\n• Equalizer, bass boost and surround\n• Sleep timer\n• Synced lyrics (.lrc files)\n• 8 color themes, light and dark mode\n• Favorites, recently played and most played\n• No internet permission, no ads, no trackers</string>
